me Slider\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"100\" role=\"slider\"><span class=\"mejs-offscreen\">Use Up/Down Arrow keys to increase or decrease volume.</span><div class=\"mejs-horizontal-volume-total\"><div class=\"mejs-horizontal-volume-current\" style=\"left: 0px; width: 100%;\"></div><div class=\"mejs-horizontal-volume-handle\" style=\"left: 100%; margin-left: -5px;\"></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_38 et_pb_row et_pb_row_3-4_1-4 et_block_row et_block_row_3-4_1-4\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_48 et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_4 et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_35 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"114\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>Name</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"120\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Liam</span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"120\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Clare</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"114\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>Age</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"120\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">18</span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"120\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">19</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"114\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>City / country</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"120\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">New York, USA</span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"120\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chicago, USA</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"114\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>Favourite food</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"120\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">pizza</span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"120\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">ice cream</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"29\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>1</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"28\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">F</span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"29\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>2</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"28\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"29\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>3</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"28\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"29\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>4</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"28\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"29\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>5</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"28\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"29\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>6</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"28\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_49 et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_4 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_column_empty et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_39 et_pb_row et_block_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_50 et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_toggle_10 et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_item et_pb_toggle_close et_pb_module et_block_module\"><h5 class=\"et_pb_toggle_title\">Answer</h5><div class=\"et_pb_toggle_content clearfix\"><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>1</strong> F&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>2</strong> T&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>3</strong> F&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>4</strong> T&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>5</strong> T&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>6</strong> F</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong><em>Transcript</em></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>1</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Liam is nineteen years old.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>2</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Liam and Clare are American.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>3</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Liam is from New Orleans.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>4</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Clare is from Chicago.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>5</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Clare is nineteen years old.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>6</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Liam’s favourite food is ice cream.</span></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"et_pb_section_12 et_pb_section et_section_regular et_block_section\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_40 et_pb_row et_block_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_51 et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_36 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h3><strong><span style=\"font-size: large;\">5. Write true short answers.</span></strong></h3>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_41 et_pb_row et_block_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_52 et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_37 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>1</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Is your English teacher a man? …………………………..</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>2</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Is your Workbook green? …………………………..</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>3</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Is yellow your favourite colour? …………………………..</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>4</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Are your school friends British? …………………………..</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>5</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Are you at school? …………………………..</span></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_42 et_pb_row et_block_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_53 et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_toggle_11 et_pb_toggle et_pb_toggle_item et_pb_toggle_close et_pb_module et_block_module\"><h5 class=\"et_pb_toggle_title\">Answer</h5><div class=\"et_pb_toggle_content clearfix\"><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Your own answers</span></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"et_pb_section_13 et_pb_section et_section_regular et_block_section\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_43 et_pb_row et_block_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_54 et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_38 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h3><strong><span style=\"font-size: large;\">6. Write the possessive adjectives for the personal pronouns.</span></strong></h3>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_44 et_pb_row et_block_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_55 et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_39 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>1&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>I&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; …<em>my</em>………………….</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>2&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>you&nbsp;&nbsp; …………………………</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>3&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>he&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; …………………………</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>4&nbsp;&nbsp;</stron